    "title": "Box Cat Jam : Block Match",
    "description": "\ud83d\ude3aBox Cat Jam \u2013 Are you looking for a cute cat match puzzle game?\ud83d\ude3a\r\nRelax your brain solving puzzle with cute cats! Match same cats to solve the puzzle!\r\n\r\nWelcome to Box Cat Jam : Match, the cutest block puzzle game that you will enjoy! Use your brain to put the same three cats to release cats from the jam. \r\n\r\nBox Cat Jam : Match \u2013 Very addictive and Relaxing cat block game!\r\nChallenge yourself to pass the stages that might be hard and feed your cats!  You will see how big the cats would grow up!\r\n\r\nHow to play Box Cat Jam: \r\n\ud83c\udf31Your goal is to match cats and clean the board.\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Tap lying cats to move them.\r\n\ud83c\udf31Match 3 same cats at the same time.\r\n\ud83c\udfc6You will win when the board is clear!\r\n\r\nbox cat match jam puzzle feature:\r\n\ud83d\ude0dCute cats and challenging stages \r\n\ud83d\ude0dCozy graphics and animation.\r\n\ud83d\ude0dFeeding Cats and competing system.\r\n\ud83d\ude0dBus stages every month\r\n\r\nDownload Box Cat Jam : Match now and start playing it now!\r\n\r\nTikTok : https://www.tiktok.com/@actionfitgames",
